# Do not use relay.nostr.band

`wss://relay.nostr.band` is a dead relay. Never add it to hardcoded lists, fallbacks, naddr/nprofile hint handling, or ad-hoc queries.

Prefer relays this app already uses (`wss://relay.damus.io`, `wss://relay.primal.net`, `wss://relay.ditto.pub`, `wss://relay.vertexlab.io`).

```ts
// ❌ BAD
"wss://relay.nostr.band"

// ✅ GOOD
"wss://relay.ditto.pub"
```

If a NIP-19 entity includes `relay.nostr.band` as a hint, drop that hint. Do not special-case other `*.nostr.band` HTTP APIs unless they are also known dead.
